@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title Runtime process identity and endpoint checks
start
:Identify existing frontend and backend processes;
:Confirm executable, project root, revision and port;
if (Existing process belongs to intended candidate?) then (yes)
 :Reuse appropriate runtime;
else (no)
 :Start required candidate runtime without taking over unrelated services;
endif
:Record actual listening endpoints;
:Check frontend, backend and API integration against those endpoints;
:Avoid attributing stale-process responses to current code;
:Stop only unnecessary processes owned by this test session;
stop
@enduml
